  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674738",
      "title": "Rendering a Modal Page (Overlay Page)",
      "lectureOrder": 45,
      "videoOrder": 40,
      "sourceHash": "ffe24fa9a4d77d8d1f9c094170fc29b1b35e285448677f21eac3547c18e1ba4a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.47,
          "en": "The idea behind this modal component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.47,
          "end": 7.38,
          "en": "is that we can wrap it around some other content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.38,
          "end": 11.449,
          "en": "and that content will then be displayed as an overlay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.449,
          "end": 14.28,
          "en": "on the page on which we currently are.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.28,
          "end": 17.43,
          "en": "And that's exactly the kind of look I want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.43,
          "end": 19.32,
          "en": "for my expenses form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.32,
          "end": 23.55,
          "en": "So if I go to my expenses and then there to the add page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.55,
          "end": 25.8,
          "en": "currently this form is displayed like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.8,
          "end": 29.1,
          "en": "and that's of course not looking that great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.1,
          "end": 31.8,
          "en": "Instead, it should be presented as an overlay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.8,
          "end": 34.47,
          "en": "on top of this expenses list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.47,
          "end": 37.47,
          "en": "And that's exactly what this modal component will do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.47,
          "end": 40.02,
          "en": "It's a very simple component, but due to the styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.02,
          "end": 42,
          "en": "provided in the Shared CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42,
          "end": 44.973,
          "en": "we will get this look, which I wanna get here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.9,
          "end": 47.79,
          "en": "So therefore what we have to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.79,
          "end": 50.7,
          "en": "is use that modal component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.7,
          "end": 55.2,
          "en": "in this expenses add and id jsx files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.2,
          "end": 58.53,
          "en": "So if we start here in the add file, I'll simply import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.53,
          "end": 62.67,
          "en": "this modal component from ~components util modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.67,
          "end": 66.3,
          "en": "And then we simply wrap it around expense form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.3,
          "end": 68.61,
          "en": "This is of course not Remix specific.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.61,
          "end": 72.723,
          "en": "This is some regular React syntax, some regular React code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.89,
          "end": 76.28999999999999,
          "en": "And I'll repeat this approach here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.28999999999999,
          "end": 79.71000000000001,
          "en": "in this $id jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.71000000000001,
          "end": 83.703,
          "en": "Here we'll also wrap this model around the expense form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.16,
          "end": 89.31,
          "en": "If we do that and we save this and go back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.31,
          "end": 91.83,
          "en": "you see now this looks much nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.83,
          "end": 95.31,
          "en": "Now this is loaded on top of this expenses list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.31,
          "end": 100.08,
          "en": "and this now also shows us the power of layouts again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.08,
          "end": 103.65,
          "en": "We're using this expenses jsx file here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.65,
          "end": 108.65,
          "en": "to create a layout that includes the ID and add jsx files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.02000000000001,
          "end": 112.68,
          "en": "This expenses jx file therefore can contain content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.68,
          "end": 116.67,
          "en": "components that are shared between ID and Add jsx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.67,
          "end": 119.85,
          "en": "In this case, it's this expenses list in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.85,
          "end": 122.19,
          "en": "This is shared between Add and id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.19,
          "end": 125.67,
          "en": "which means it's visible on the add and ID pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.67,
          "end": 129.06,
          "en": "because these two pages are child pages of expenses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.06,
          "end": 131.76,
          "en": "because they are in this expenses folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.76,
          "end": 133.65,
          "en": "That's how layouts work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.65,
          "end": 135.48,
          "en": "That is what I explained you earlier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.48,
          "end": 139.82999999999998,
          "en": "And here we see why this feature can be super useful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.82999999999998,
          "end": 141.66,
          "en": "because now with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.66,
          "end": 144.99,
          "en": "we're not just using a layout to have some shared navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.99,
          "end": 148.05,
          "en": "or anything like that as we're doing it in the Route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.05,
          "end": 149.94,
          "en": "component, in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.94,
          "end": 151.71,
          "en": "which is of course also fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.71,
          "end": 153.93,
          "en": "But here we're now using this feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.93,
          "end": 157.95,
          "en": "to have some shared content with which users can interact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.95,
          "end": 162.12,
          "en": "this list of expenses to then show other pages on top of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 162.12,
          "end": 164.16,
          "en": "To have this nice user interface",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.16,
          "end": 168.3,
          "en": "where we have this modal look for our add page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 168.3,
          "end": 170.01,
          "en": "because that's all important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.01,
          "end": 173.79,
          "en": "This part here, this form, that's a separate page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.79,
          "end": 175.5,
          "en": "It's not a full screen page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 175.5,
          "end": 177.54,
          "en": "It doesn't occupy the entire screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.54,
          "end": 181.5,
          "en": "but it is a different page because it has its own URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.5,
          "end": 185.58,
          "en": "If I remove the add segment, we see just the list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.58,
          "end": 188.13,
          "en": "If I add it, we see that modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.13,
          "end": 192.06,
          "en": "So we can link, we can navigate two such pages as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.06,
          "end": 195.84,
          "en": "We don't have to deal with full screen pages only.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.84,
          "end": 199.53,
          "en": "Now, that's not a Remix exclusive approach or a feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 199.53,
          "end": 201.54,
          "en": "but Remix makes it particularly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.54,
          "end": 203.55,
          "en": "easy to implement such solutions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.55,
          "end": 206.19,
          "en": "because of this layout Route feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.19,
          "end": 207.78300000000002,
          "en": "which we are using here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
